docs {
  # Update ASH Online Registration Status
  
  Updates the admission status of an ASH Online student.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `update` permission.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                               |
  |-----------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------------|
  | status    | string | Yes      | One of: `accepted`, `rejected`, `pending` |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the updated status information.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "ASH Online student status updated successfully",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "status": "accepted",
      "name": "john"
    },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
}
